WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.912
Section 1.

00:00:01.862 --> 00:00:04.112
The Numbers That Damn Them.

00:00:04.112 --> 00:00:08.500
6.5 million Canadians are without a family doctor.

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:12.387
Wait times regularly exceed clinical benchmarks.

00:00:12.387 --> 00:00:16.762
These are the Canadian government's own measurements of its own failure.
